    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ca̱p Cɛba kɛ mi jiäk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cuɛ lɛ tuɔɔk ɛn ɣöö cuɛ tekɛ ram mi thil luɔt, mi cɔal i̱ Cɛba gat Bik-ri, raan Ben-ya-min. Cuɛ kaaŋ koth kä cuɛ wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal rɔ̱ guath kä Dee-bid, kä cukɛ Cɛba gat Bik-ri guɔ̱ɔ̱r. Kä cu ji̱ Juda kuääriɛn guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni kä Jɔr-dɛn cu amäni Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ben dhɔrɛ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. Kä cu kuäär luɔɔmkɛ da̱ŋ wäl tëë cɛ ba̱ny ɣöö ba cieŋ lɔ̱ɔ̱ gaŋ ka̱n, cuɛ kɛ la̱th dhɔr mi yienkɛ, cuɛ kɛ moc ti diaal, duundɛ ɣöö /cɛ tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ kɛ. Cukɛ tëë wi̱ni amäni lia̱a̱diɛn, ce̱tkɛ kɛ män ti thil cɔw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär Ä-ma-tha jiök i̱, “Cio̱li ɣä ji̱ Juda guäth kɛl kɛ ni̱n da̱ŋ diɔ̱k, kä ber wa̱nɛ mi puɔ̱nydu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ä-ma-tha wä wee ji̱ Juda cɔl. Ɛ ni ɣöö cuɛ jääny kɛ gua̱th ëë ca la̱r jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid Ä-bi-cay jiök i̱, “Täämɛ Cɛba gat Bik-ri bɛ kɔn lät kä mi bɛc ni jɛn kä Ɛ̈b-ca-lom. Käni nɛɛkä wër guuri jɛ, kiɛ bɛ rɔ jek wi̱i̱ ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m a bɛ rɔ bar kä kɔn.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-bi-cay kɛnɛ nɛɛ Yo-ab wä kɔɔriɛn kɛ ji̱ Kɛ-reth, kɛnɛ ji̱ Pɛ-lɛth, kɛ wutni ko̱o̱r diaal. Cukɛ jiɛɛn kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm guɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ Cɛba gat Bik-ri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min tekɛ pääm in di̱i̱t kä Gib-yon, cu Ä-ma-tha ben römɛ kɛ kɛ. Kä Yo-ab cɛ bi̱i̱ rɛ̈m la̱th kä tëë la̱a̱k lɛtädɛ kɛ thɛp mi te rɛy go̱kädɛ, min wëë kɛ cu thep pɛ̈ɛ̈n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-ab Ä-ma-tha jiök i̱, “Mal puɔ̱nydu jɔɔk gatmaar?” Kä cuɛ käp ti̱kdɛ kɛ tet cueecdɛ ciimɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö /ken Ä-ma-tha thɛp in te tetdä Yo-ab ŋa̱c. Kä cu Yo-ab ɛ yiɛth ni jicdɛ, kä cu ci̱nkɛ lɛny ni piny, kä cuɛ li̱w, /kenɛ jɛ nyɔk kɛ yiëth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-ab kɛnɛ däman ni Ä-bi-cay Cɛba gat Bik-ri guɔ̱ɔ̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ram kɛl kä nɛɛ Yo-ab cuɔ̱ŋ gekä Ä-ma-tha kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Ram mi la raan Yo-ab kɛnɛ Dee-bid, a jɛ guur Yo-ab.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Ä-ma-tha ri̱ŋdɛ te ni rɛy riɛmdɛ därduɔ̱p in di̱i̱t. Kä ram mi ci ben a cɛ jɛ nɛn la cuŋɛ. Kä min cɛ jɛ nɛn cuŋ nɛy diaal, cuɛ riŋ Ä-ma-tha woc dup in di̱i̱t cuɛ jɛ kap rɛy ka̱a̱ni, kä cuɛ bi̱i̱ yuɔr wi̱i̱dɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Min cɛ jɛ woc dup, cu nɛy diaal wä kɔɔr Yo-ab guɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ Cɛba gat Bik-ri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Cɛba thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal bak amäni A-bel Beth-mɛ̈-kaa, amäni wi̱i̱ ji̱ Bik-ri diaal tëë wa rɔ dol, kä cua jɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r rɛy wec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal tin te kɔɔr Yo-ab jɛ ben go̱l rɛy wec A-bel Beth-mɛ̈-kaa. Kä cukɛ ko̱o̱tni täth jɔɔk pa̱a̱ny wec raar, kä cukɛ päny wec tɛt, kɛ ɣöö bɛ tɛɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ciek mi pɛl ciöt rɛy wec wee i̱, “Liŋɛ! Liŋɛ! Jiökɛ Yo-ab i̱, ‘Ber wa̱nɛ mi, bä ben ruac kɛ ji̱.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-ab ben thiekä ciek. Kä cu ciek wee i̱, “Ɛ ji̱n Yo-ab?” Kä cu Yo-ab ɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ ɣän.” Kä cu ciek ɛ jiök i̱, “Liŋ ruacdä.” Kä cuɛ loc i̱, “Liɛŋä jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “La jɛ ɛ larkɛ ni wal i̱, ‘Pälkɛ duundɛ ɣöö thiecɛ kä A-bel.’ Inɔ cukɛ jɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ɣän ram kɛl kä ji̱ malä, kä ŋa̱th kä I-thɛ-rɛl. Go̱ri ɣöö däki wec in di̱t ni jɛn Kä I-thɛ-rɛl. Ɛŋu go̱o̱ri ɣöö däki wec Kuɔth Nhial ɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-ab ɛ loc i̱, “Aal cä jɛ go̱r i̱ bä wecdun yia̱r kiɛ bä jɛ däk! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ciɛ ɣän. Duundɛ ɣöö ɛ raan wec päämni Ɛ-pa-rim, mi cɔali Cɛba gat Bik-ri, cɛ rɔ riet kuäär ni Dee-bid. Käm ni jɛ nɛy ba̱kɔ rɔ̱ woc wi̱c.” Kä cu ciek Yo-ab jiök i̱, “Nɛn ɛ, ba ji̱ yuɔ̱r wi̱cdɛ kɛ wi̱c pa̱a̱ny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ciek wä kä nɛy diaal kɛ pɛlɛ. Kä cukɛ wi̱c Cɛba gat Bik-ri ŋok, kä cuɛ yuɔ̱r Yo-ab. Kä cuɛ kaaŋ koth, kä cukɛ jiɛɛn wi̱c, cu ramɔ wä dhɔrɛ. Kä cu Yo-ab loc kä kuäär kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ji̱ kɔaar Dee-bid",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Yo-ab ɛ jɛn bo̱o̱th rɛ̈m kä I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä Bɛ-na-yaa gat Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da ɛ bo̱o̱th ji̱ Kɛ-reth kɛnɛ ji̱ Pɛ-lɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Ä-do-ram te wi̱i̱ la̱a̱tni. Kä cu Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat gat Ä-ɣi-lud a bulkamiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Cɛ-ya a bolith. Kä cu Dha-dok kɛnɛ Ɛb-ya-thar a bo̱o̱th palä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ira raan Ya-ir a bo̱o̱th palä Dee-bid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
